      "output": "Partial Autocorrelation Function (PACF) Order Identification (True AR(2)):\n======================================================================\nSample Size N=122 | Bartlett 95% Cutoff: +/- 0.177\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nLag    | Sample PACF    | Status           | Theoretical Expectation\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nLag 1  |    0.712       | SIGNIFICANT [OK] | Non-Zero Spike\nLag 2  |    0.246       | SIGNIFICANT [OK] | Non-Zero Spike\nLag 3  |   -0.160       | Noise (Zero)     | Zero Cutoff\nLag 4  |    0.085       | Noise (Zero)     | Zero Cutoff\nLag 5  |    0.022       | Noise (Zero)     | Zero Cutoff\nLag 6  |   -0.013       | Noise (Zero)     | Zero Cutoff\n======================================================================\nConclusion: PACF cuts off sharply after Lag 2, conclusively identifying an AR(2) model!"
