      "output": "Conditional Least Squares (CLS) Parameter Estimation (Target: theta = 0.60):\n===========================================================================\nSample Size N=119 | True Parameter: theta = 0.60\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nParameter        | Estimated Value  | Std Error    | z-Statistic  | p-Value\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIntercept (mu)   |        40.15     | N/A          | N/A          | N/A\nMA(1) (theta)    |        0.653     |      0.074   |       8.88   | 0.0000 (p < 0.001)\n===========================================================================\nEstimation Accuracy: Error is only 0.053 (8.9%)"
