        "answerIndex": 0,
        "why": "For binary classification, Gini = 1 - p_0^2 - p_1^2 = 2 * p_0 * p_1. When p_0 = 1, Gini = 0 (pure); when p_0 = 0.5, Gini = 0.5 (maximum impurity)."
